  "non_rules": [
    "theorem inventories do not imply qsrc qart qext qven or general implementation soundness",
    "digest rows and locator identity do not imply external archive equivalence venue acceptance qsrc qart qext qven or general implementation soundness",
    "local paths and historical snapshots do not imply any upgrade coordinate",
    "bounded source-interface rows do not imply fresh Lean rebuild source-theory completeness or axiom-purity audit",
    "artifact rows do not imply dynamic artifact semantic validation",
    "dated venue-readiness rows do not imply upload-time venue compliance or venue acceptance",
    "stableLocator plus archiveByteEquality may derive locatorOKstageA for replay identity but does not derive qext without externalArchiveEquivalence",
